1
00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:01,262
Before a resurrection,

2
00:00:01,625 --> 00:00:02,638
there must be a reckoning.

3
00:00:03,062 --> 00:00:05,087
The first job is to clear away half

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,300
a century of neglect.

5
00:00:06,712 --> 00:00:08,125
The vines are pulled back,

6
00:00:08,412 --> 00:00:11,375
revealing intricate stonework that hasn't felt the sun

7
00:00:11,388 --> 00:00:12,350
in fifty years.

8
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:15,675
Rotten timber and collapsed plaster are hauled out

9
00:00:15,688 --> 00:00:16,550
of the great hall,

10
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:17,762
layer by layer,

11
00:00:18,162 --> 00:00:20,888
until the foundation of the estate is exposed.

12
00:00:21,312 --> 00:00:23,000
This is the most brutal phase,

13
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,512
where everything looks worse before it looks better.

14
00:00:25,938 --> 00:00:28,175
The skeleton of the mansion stands open to

15
00:00:28,188 --> 00:00:28,700
the sky.

16
00:00:29,125 --> 00:00:31,838
Scaffolding rises around it like a steel cage,

17
00:00:32,212 --> 00:00:33,900
holding up a fragile giant.

18
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:35,700
But as the dust settles,

19
00:00:35,888 --> 00:00:37,463
the archways breathe again,

20
00:00:37,838 --> 00:00:39,688
and the flow of the rooms makes sense

21
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,387
once more.

22
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,000
It is no longer a ruin.

23
00:00:42,412 --> 00:00:43,812
It is a canvas wiped clean.
